function seasonAdvancedStats(games,t,huckDistance=huckYards){const rows=new Map(),settings=secondaryEdgeSettings();for(const g of games){const result=advancedStatsFor(g,t,gameOse(g,t),settings.previousShare,settings.previousPreviousShare,settings.includeInTotal,huckDistance);for(const row of result.rows){if(!rows.has(row.id))rows.set(row.id,{...row});else for(const key of ['points','oPoints','dPoints','opportunities','defenseOpportunities','guardedDefenseOpportunities','defenseOpportunitiesFromD','defenseOpportunitiesFromO','opponentScoredFromD','opponentScoredFromO','passes','completions','catches','initiated','goals','assists','secondaryAssists','throwaways','drops','blocks','throwDistance','throwGain','catchDistance','catchGain','throwAllowed','receiveAllowed','goalsAllowed','assistsAllowed','targets','forcedThrowaways','breaks','breaksAllowed','pulls','pullsOutOfBounds','pullsInBounds','pullVerticalTotal','pullHorizontalTotal','huckAttempts','huckCompletions','plusMinus','throwingEdge','receivingEdge','secondaryThrowingEdge','totalEdge','throwEdgeAllowed','receiveEdgeAllowed','edgeAllowed'])rows.get(row.id)[key]+=row[key];}}for(const row of rows.values()){row.huckCompletionRate=row.huckAttempts?row.huckCompletions/row.huckAttempts:0;row.pullVertical=row.pullsInBounds?row.pullVerticalTotal/row.pullsInBounds:0;row.pullHorizontal=row.pullsInBounds?row.pullHorizontalTotal/row.pullsInBounds:0;row.totalEdgePerPoint=row.opportunities?row.totalEdge/row.opportunities:0;row.edgeAllowedPerPoint=row.guardedDefenseOpportunities?row.edgeAllowed/row.guardedDefenseOpportunities:0;row.opponentScoredRate=row.defenseOpportunities?(row.opponentScoredFromD+row.opponentScoredFromO)/row.defenseOpportunities:0;row.opponentScoredRateFromD=row.defenseOpportunitiesFromD?row.opponentScoredFromD/row.defenseOpportunitiesFromD:0;row.opponentScoredRateFromO=row.defenseOpportunitiesFromO?row.opponentScoredFromO/row.defenseOpportunitiesFromO:0;const touches=row.catches+row.initiated;row.totalEdgePerTouch=touches?row.totalEdge/touches:0;}return [...rows.values()];}
function seasonAdvancedForTeams(games,teams,huckDistance=huckYards){const rows=[];for(const t of teams)rows.push(...seasonAdvancedStats(games.filter(g=>g.teamId===t.id),t,huckDistance));return rows;}
function refreshAdjustedOutliers(body){for(const side of ['hold','opponentHold']){const cells=[...body.querySelectorAll(`[data-adjusted-side="${side}"]`)],values=cells.filter(cell=>cell.dataset.adjustedValue!=='').map(cell=>Number(cell.dataset.adjustedValue)),mean=values.reduce((sum,value)=>sum+value,0)/(values.length||1),stdev=Math.sqrt(values.reduce((sum,value)=>sum+(value-mean)**2,0)/(values.length||1));for(const cell of cells){cell.classList.remove('outlier-high','outlier-low','outlier-border','outlier-tier3','outlier-tier4');cell.removeAttribute('data-outlier-tooltip');if(!highlightOutliers||!stdev||cell.dataset.adjustedValue==='')continue;const z=(Number(cell.dataset.adjustedValue)-mean)/stdev,magnitude=Math.abs(z);if(magnitude<=1)continue;cell.classList.add(z>0?'outlier-high':'outlier-low');if(magnitude>=2)cell.classList.add(magnitude>=4?'outlier-tier4':magnitude>=3?'outlier-tier3':'outlier-border');cell.dataset.outlierTooltip=`${z>=0?'+':''}${z.toFixed(2)} standard deviations from the column mean`;}}}
